        "El pasajero abre la app y un agente conversacional pregunta fechas, presupuesto y preferencias. Analiza su historial, sugiere 3 opciones (estándar, premium, curada) con ancillaries pre-seleccionados y precio dinámico. Cierra la compra en 5 minutos sin salir del chat.": "The passenger opens the app and a conversational agent asks for dates, budget and preferences. It analyzes their history and suggests 3 options (standard, premium, curated) with pre-selected ancillaries and dynamic pricing. The purchase closes in 5 minutes without leaving the chat.",
        "Copiloto de búsqueda: cruza CRM, historial y datos de mercado (competencia, clima, eventos).": "Search copilot: cross-references CRM, history and market data (competition, weather, events).",
        "Motor de precios agéntico: genera 3 opciones validadas contra inventario.": "Agentic pricing engine: generates 3 options validated against inventory.",
        "Recomendador de ancillaries: predice preferencias con un score de likelihood.": "Ancillary recommender: predicts preferences with a likelihood score.",
